  "description": "Apathetic chaebol heir Tae-Seo Gwon drifts aimlessly through life until a scandal sees him banished to Seongu Village—a backwater town so isolated it lacks even a cafe. There, he meets Yu-Na An, a resilient convenience store worker enduring a harsh home life. Much to his surprise, her warmth breaks through his cynical exterior and ignites a deep bond between them. Over four years, Yu-Na defies all odds to become a rising star. But when Tae-Seo’s older brother pressures her to walk away, Yu-Na makes a devastating choice to disappear, leaving Tae-Seo in utter shock.\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
